  <activityDataset>
    <activityDescription>
      <activity id="e680e9dd-3f71-577a-b42a-fba588a16508" activityNameId="7040baaf-886e-57f3-a3a3-920f9ec0f2ef" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Polyphenylene sulfide, at plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Polyphenylene sulfide, at plant
The functional unit represent 1 kg of solid PPS. Large uncertainty of the process data due to weak data on the production process and missing data on process emissions.;
CAS number: 009016-75-5; 
Synonyms: PPS; 
UUID: e6bb879c-8f26-352d-85ad-4972078ccab2
Raw materials and chemicals used for production, transport of materials to manufacturing plant, estimated emissions to air and water from production (incomplete), estimation of energy demand and infrastructure of the plant (approximation). Solid wastes omitted.
Location: &lt;null&gt;
Technology: Production from sodium sulfide nonahydrate (itself produced out of sodium hydroxide and hydrogen sulfide) and P-dichlorobenzene in an N-methyl-2-pyrrolidone solution with a yield of 85%. Inventory bases on patent information. The emissions to air (0.2 wt.% of raw material input) and water were estimated using mass balance. Treatment of the waste water in a internal waste water treatment plant assumed (elimination efficiency of 90% for C).
Time period: undefined
Production volume: na
Sampling: US patent information &amp; own assumptions 
Extrapolations: &lt;null&gt;
Uncertainty adjustments: &lt;null&gt;
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_e6bb879c-8f26-352d-85ad-4972078ccab2.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
      <geography geographyId="f4808887-5a57-5892-975e-ba0565a93e23" geographyContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83">
        <shortname xml:lang="en">GLO</shortname>
        <comment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Location: &lt;null&gt;</text>
        </comment>
      </geography>
      <technology>
        <comment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Technology: Production from sodium sulfide nonahydrate (itself produced out of sodium hydroxide and hydrogen sulfide) and P-dichlorobenzene in an N-methyl-2-pyrrolidone solution with a yield of 85%. Inventory bases on patent information. The emissions to air (0.2 wt.% of raw material input) and water were estimated using mass balance. Treatment of the waste water in a internal waste water treatment plant assumed (elimination efficiency of 90% for C).</text>
        </comment>
      </technology>
      <timePeriod startDate="2004-01-01" endDate="2004-12-31" isDataValidForEntirePeriod="true">
        <comment>
